<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal insurance premiums rise 20 pct Jan-Oct.</title>
<headline>Portugal insurance premiums rise 20 pct Jan-Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese insurance premiums rose 19.7 percent to 645.04 billion escudos over the first 10 months of the year, compared with the same period in 1995, the Portuguese Insurer's Association said.</p>
<p>Life insurance premiums rose 33.5 percent to 281.2 billion, while pension plans rose 99 percent to 22.61 billion.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
